app description//

Pixvera Pro is your all-in-one document and photo toolkit — scan, edit, sign, and export, all processed privately on your device.

📄 Smart Document Scanner
Scan any paper document using automatic edge detection powered by Apple's native scanner engine. Multi-page scans are combined into a single, clean PDF — ready to share, print, or store.

🔤 On-Device Text Recognition (OCR)
Extract text from any scanned document or photo instantly using Apple's Vision framework — fully offline, no internet required. Copy the text or export it as a standalone .txt file.

🎨 Pro Photo Editor
Fine-tune your photos with professional filters — Document Scan, Auto-Enhance, Monochrome, Sepia, Warm Studio, Cool Film, Vignette, and Invert. Adjust brightness, contrast, saturation, and sharpness with live preview.

✂️ Crop, Resize & Rotate
Crop to standard aspect ratios (1:1, 4:3, 16:9, 3:2, 9:16), resize to exact dimensions or presets (1080p, Square, Story, Passport), and rotate with a single tap.

✍️ Digital Signature & Stamp Studio
Draw your signature or a custom stamp using Apple Pencil or your finger, with adjustable ink color and thickness. Export as a transparent PNG or embed directly into a PDF.

🖼️ Images to PDF Converter
Select up to 50 photos, arrange them in your preferred order, and merge them into a single multi-page PDF booklet.

🔒 Privacy-First by Design
Every feature — scanning, OCR, editing, signing — runs entirely on your device. Nothing is uploaded, tracked, or shared without your action. Strip EXIF/GPS metadata from photos before sharing them, for extra privacy.

🖨️ Direct AirPrint Support
Print any saved document straight from your Vault over Wi-Fi — no extra apps needed.

📁 Built-In Vault
All your scans, edited photos, signatures, and PDFs are organized in one place, with file size at a glance and one-tap share or print.

Whether you're digitizing receipts, signing a form, prepping a photo for social media, or building a PDF portfolio — Pixvera Pro handles it all, privately and offline.
